siness_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VkwNVWThOZbiDbjWQbnJew","review_id":"fCqMAKgQXMtWkY45qrV1Ug","date":"2021-06-26T19:47:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9496542811393738,"text_excerpt":"Don't let the fact that this spot is located in a small strip mall deter you. It's some of the best pizza and Italian food you will ever have. I had lunch here a few days ago and it was delicious. I enjoyed the margherita pizza, the white pizza, boudin egg rolls, Mount Vesuvius shrimp, meatballs, and spinach dip. Yeah, it was a lot! Thankfully, I was sharing with a few people. The pizza here is authentic New York style pizza with that perfect thin crust and cheese and sauce that speaks for itself. The place is family owned and the service is super friendly. It's a small spot, so give the crew some heads up if you plan on being in a big group. Otherwise, take out is a great option. I love ..."},{"business_id":"VkwNVWThOZbiDbjWQbnJew","review_id":"b-BY0lUu4ey9J97vVoaEVA","date":"2021-04-09T20:50:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9401503205299377,"text_excerpt":"Pretty good Lakeview pizza spot, good dough and tasty, filling, gooey New York style sauce. I got the Pepperoni, but curious to try the other toppings. They closed on Tuesdays so don't accidentally order using the app, because there ain't nobody there. Next to a food store so you can get your dranks next door. No complaints, cept some of us want our pizzas Tuesdays too."},{"business_id":"VkwNVWThOZbiDbjWQbnJew","review_id":"fU7VfacxysERAqur1OOgKg","date":"2021-07-23T20:34:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9106321334838867,"text_excerpt":"The Crazy Italian uses actual water from New York to Jake their pizza dough. We had the large pepperoni and it's definitely a big \"football \" style pizza. The crust has New York pizza chew and is a lot of pizza for under twenty bucks."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VkwNVWThOZbiDbjWQbnJew","photo_id":"B5H97ztCoRh6Y7Ah0Fblzg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/B5H97ztCoRh6Y7Ah0Fblzg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9999998807907104}]},"notebook_case":null}
